cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "US-HealthBench: an evaluation framework for LLM systems on official U.S. public-health guidance, with a defect audit of the benchmark it produced"
message: "If you use this framework or the audit, please cite it as below. The item set is provisional and should not be used to score systems."
type: software
